# data & artifacts — never commit corpora, checkpoints, or model binaries
data/
checkpoints/
artifacts/*
# ...but DO version the benchmark evidence. docs/benchmarks.md is the deliverable
# (§18), and a claim whose backing JSON is untracked is a claim with no evidence.
# These are ~200 KB of JSON; the GGUF exports next to them are ~90 MB and stay out.
!artifacts/benchmarks/
!artifacts/benchmarks/**
*.bin
*.idx
*.safetensors
*.gguf
mlruns/
.superpowers/

